### User B edits user A's post -> 403
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/post/{{postId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{benToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Hacked title",
  "body": "Ben should not be able to do this."
}

### User A edits own post -> 200
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/post/{{postId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{annaToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Butter Chicken (Updated)",
  "body": "Added a splash of cream at the end.",
  "imageUrl": "{{imageUrl}}"
}

### Post doesn't exist -> 404
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/post/999999
Authorization: Bearer {{annaToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Ghost post",
  "body": "Does not exist"
}
